-- Invented members and cards, written by a replica of the legacy application
-- through its own models, so every row is a row that application would write
-- and every hash is one it would store.
--
-- Rule 13 of CLAUDE.md: every address here ends in .invalid, which can never
-- resolve, and every password was chosen for this file.
--
-- Deliberately dirty. It holds a card below slot 10, a card above 199, a card
-- owned by a user that does not exist, a member with a blank email, and a card
-- carrying permission 20. Each one is a question
-- docs/plan/order-of-operations.md phase 0 asks of the production data.
--
-- It also holds an admin, an instructor, an accountant, a member with a waiver
-- date, a member with a payee, and a member oriented by another member, so that
-- 040_not_carried.sql has something to report rather than a column of zeros.

